ent-BlueshieldLifelineImplant = Blueshield LifeLine implant
    .desc = Extracts its host and anyone they carry to the Central Command infirmary, once. Activates manually or on the host's death.
ent-ActionActivateBlueshieldLifeline = Activate LifeLine
    .desc = Evacuate to the Central Command infirmary, alone or with the person in your arms. Single use. A nuclear authentication disk blocks extraction.
ent-BlueshieldLifelineArrival = Blueshield LifeLine arrival point
blueshield-lifeline-disk = LifeLine detected a nuclear authentication disk. Leave the disk behind to evacuate.
blueshield-lifeline-no-signal = LifeLine could not reach a Central Command arrival point. Charge retained.
